INSERT INTO game_translations (game_id, language_code, title, description) SELECT id, 'en', 'King God Castle', '- Your luck will decide which hero you will strengthen and which weapon will appear. To use what is given efficiently to defeat enemies is strategy and tactics! Fostering and combining my own heroes! - Choose the 6 most strategic heroes. Gold coins and jewels from the battle. Use them to strengthen your heroes and bring out your potential. Strengthening heroes through the power of the gods! - Strengthen the altar to enlist the help of the gods. It''s the only thing that''s gonna make the heroes the strongest. Choose an altar and gain divine power. Enemies of various characteristics! - Enemies using various characteristics and skills invade. I don''t know if I''m gonna use magic to wipe it out. It''s up to you to take it down step by step. I adjust the difficulty of my enemies. Challenge! - You can use the challenge system to strengthen your enemies and earn more rewards.' FROM games WHERE igdb_id = 203220 ON CONFLICT (game_id, language_code) DO NOTHING;
